    "audit_correction_required": false,
    "cause": "The audit is correct and the failure is actual runtime pickup latency, not attribution. The primary Flayer episode established an exact one-second remote-cluster handoff, but the global Stampeding Roar branch preempted the existing Charge-first handoff, consumed the GCD, and allowed the reservation to expire into generic density movement while the same healer-owned identities expanded into a twelve-hostile cluster. A separate post-recovery episode began while the Feral tank was out of Bear Form; ordinary route approach spent 2556 ms before restoring Bear Form, so native Growl did not run until 3070 ms after exposure began. Both episodes independently exceed the unchanged 3000-ms dwell ceiling.",
